# live_screen_matches_oracle's second launch (UI-WINDOW-1 fix round R5): the idle HUD before the
# first founding, the state the oracle's shot hud_idle_running shows (no city: no materials or
# residents in the status bar). Launched on the ship start (lan5-ship-a.json, seat 0), which has
# no city yet; tools/test/live_screen_compare.py compares the screenshot pixel for pixel.
resize 1024 768
wait frames 30
# UI-STATUS-1 B: the fact names the groups shown (gold only); no island is discovered before the
# first founding (OQ-701), so the fertility row is hidden and live_screen_compare.py leaves its
# slots out of this screen.
expect fact hud.counters == gold
# The gold figure is drawn before the first founding (its digits are live: masks.txt gold_digits).
expect fact hud.gold != none
expect fact hud.fertility == hidden
screenshot hud_idle_live
quit
